# Security Notes:
# - Never commit .env files to version control
# - Use different credentials for development, staging, and production
# - Regularly rotate your secrets
# - Consider using Azure Key Vault or similar for production environments

# Note: ASP.NET Core uses __ (double underscore) as hierarchy separator in environment variables
# Example: EmailConfiguration__Password maps to EmailConfiguration:Password in JSON